                    from Wriggins to Walt Rostow and Bundy, which lists the participants as
                    Ambassador Burns, Katzenbach, Eugene Rostow, and Kohler. (Johnson Library,
                    National Security File, Country File, Middle East Crisis, Vol. VIII)</p>
            </note>
